        <div class='features_wrapper'>
             <div class="features_main_content"><div id="7000feature_0_4" class="feature_image"><div class="features_content_image"><a href="/real-or-virtual-money-fuels-kids-holiday-gimmes"><img src="http://cdn1.www.commonsensemedia.org/sites/default/files/imagecache/homepage_rotator/images/HP-buyingbug.jpg" alt="" title=""  class="imagecache imagecache-homepage_rotator" /></a></div><div class="features_content_text"><div class='top'><h2>Does Playing With Money Make Kids Greedy?</h2><p><a href="/real-or-virtual-money-fuels-kids-holiday-gimmes">With so much cash changing hands online, how can parents teach kids the value of a virtual dollar?</a></p></div><div class='bottom'><p><strong><a href="/game-lists/gift-ideas-our-kids-games-picks">Ultimate Video Game Wish List</a></strong> </p><p><strong><a href="/privacy">Protecting Kids' Privacy Online</a></strong> </p></div></div></div><div id="7000feature_1_4" class="feature_image"><div class="features_content_image"><a href="/game-lists/gift-ideas-our-kids-games-picks"><img src="http://cdn1.www.commonsensemedia.org/sites/default/files/imagecache/homepage_rotator/images/EpicMickeyPaint-HP.jpg" alt="" title=""  class="imagecache imagecache-homepage_rotator" /></a></div><div class="features_content_text"><div class='top'><h2>Ultimate Video Game Wish List</h2><p><a href="/game-lists/gift-ideas-our-kids-games-picks">From <i>Super Mario</i> to <i>Epic Mickey</i> -- we tell you all about the games your kids are asking for. </a></p></div><div class='bottom'><p><strong><a href="/privacy">Protecting Kids' Privacy Online</a></strong> </p><p><strong><a href="/real-or-virtual-money-fuels-kids-holiday-gimmes">Does Playing With Money Make Kids Greedy?</a></strong> </p></div></div></div><div id="7000feature_2_4" class="feature_image"><div class="features_content_image"><a href="/privacy"><img src="http://cdn1.www.commonsensemedia.org/sites/default/files/imagecache/homepage_rotator/images/privacyrotatorbanner.jpg" alt="" title=""  class="imagecache imagecache-homepage_rotator" /></a></div><div class="features_content_text"><div class='top'><h2>Protecting Kids' Privacy Online</h2><p><a href="/privacy">Do you believe that kids and families should have the right to control their personal information? </a></p></div><div class='bottom'><p><strong><a href="/real-or-virtual-money-fuels-kids-holiday-gimmes">Does Playing With Money Make Kids Greedy?</a></strong> </p><p><strong><a href="/game-lists/gift-ideas-our-kids-games-picks">Ultimate Video Game Wish List</a></strong> </p></div></div></div></div><div id="popular"><h3>Most Popular with Members</h3><div class="content"><p><a href="/website-reviews/youtube"><div class="teaser"><div class="hpImage"><a href="/website-reviews/youtube"><img src="http://cdn1.www.commonsensemedia.org/sites/default/files/imagecache/homepage_teaser_image/youtube.gif" alt="youtube.gif" title=""  class="imagecache imagecache-homepage_teaser_image" /></a></div><div id="rollover-nid-355865" class="rollover"><div class="rollover-inner"><span class="heading"><span>YouTube</span> </span><div class="summary"><h5>Parents Need to Know...</h5><p> that YouTube offers parents the ability to filter out objectionable content using its Safety Mode. Safety Mode is an opt-in feature -- meaning you need to enable it on your browser -- that filters both videos and comments. YouTube also ... <a href="/website-reviews/youtube#what-parents-need-to-know">read more</a></p></div><div class="rollover-user-actions" style="margin-top:-20px">&nbsp;</div></div></div><div class="recommended_age age_yellow">Age <span>13+</span></div></div></a></p><h4>YouTube</h4><div class='rate'><strong>Parents Rate It</strong><div class="fivestar-widget-static fivestar-widget-static-vote fivestar-widget-static-5 clear-block"><div class="star star-1 star-odd star-first"><span class="on">4</span></div><div class="star star-2 star-even"><span class="on"></span></div><div class="star star-3 star-odd"><span class="on"></span></div><div class="star star-4 star-even"><span class="on"></span></div><div class="star star-5 star-odd star-last"><span class="off"></span></div></div></div><div class='rate'><strong>Kids Rate It</strong><div class="fivestar-widget-static fivestar-widget-static-vote fivestar-widget-static-5 clear-block"><div class="star star-1 star-odd star-first"><span class="on">4</span></div><div class="star star-2 star-even"><span class="on"></span></div><div class="star star-3 star-odd"><span class="on"></span></div><div class="star star-4 star-even"><span class="on"></span></div><div class="star star-5 star-odd star-last"><span class="off"></span></div></div></div></div></div>        </div>

